      "writtenOn": "2021-12-15T16:58:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the difference being that with what we currently have, an external/ project can\u0027t even opt _in_, whereas with this they\u0027re opted out by default, but can opt back in if they so choose?",
      "parentUuid": "43c27302_a708b04f",
      "revId": "e24303f71ae13fae7b5b805196487731dde09be8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
